==English==
{{wp}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|her|id=here}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hēr|t=at this place}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*hēr}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hē₂r}}, from {{suffix|gem-pro|*hiz|*r|nocat=1}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro||*kís}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ḱe}} + {{m|ine-pro|*ís}}.

{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|stq|hier}}, {{cog|fy|hjir}}, {{cog|nl|hier}}, {{cog|nds-de|hier}}, {{cog|de|hier}}, {{cog|da|her}}, {{cog|sv|här}}, {{cog|no|her}}, {{cog|fo|her}}, {{cog|is|hér}}. Also related to the English pronoun {{m|en|he|t=this/that person}}, and the words {{m|en|hither|t=to this place}} and {{m|en|hence|t=from this place}}.
{{col-bottom}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/hɪə̯/|a=RP}}
** {{audio|en|En-uk-here.ogg|a=UK|q=female voice}}
** {{audio|en|En-uk-hear.ogg|a=UK|q=male voice}}
* {{IPA|en|/hɪː/|/ˈhɪjə/|a=SSBE}}
** {{audio|en|En-here.oga|a=UK|IPA=/ˈhɪjə/}}
* {{IPA|en|/hɪɹ/|/hiɹ/|a=GA,CA}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-here.ogg|a=US}}
* {{IPA|en|/hɪː/|a=AU}}
** {{IPA|en|/hiːə/|/hɪə/|a=Western Australia,Queensland}}
* {{IPA|en|/hiːr/|/hiːɹ/|a=Scotland}}
