** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Back ache-sorry.wav|a=London}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɑɹi/|a=GA,CA}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-sorry.ogg|a=California|IPA=[ˈsɑɹ.i]}}
** {{homophones|en|sari}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsoɹi/|a=Ottawa Valley}}
** {{IPA|en|[ˈsɔɹɪ]|[ˈsoːɹɪ]}}
*** {{audio|en|en-ca-sorry.ogg|IPA=[ˈsɔː.ɹi]}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɔɹi/|a=AU}}
